#!/bin/bash

# tam-toggle-nightlight — toggle the night light screen temperature
# (SUPER + CTRL + N, Trigger → Toggle → Nightlight).
#
#   tam-toggle-nightlight [--status]
#
# --status prints {"enabled":…,"temperature":…} as JSON and changes nothing.
#
# Ported from Omarchy 4.0.4 (omarchy-toggle-nightlight) for plan 18 0.2.3.
# Changed: the Omarchy bar's indicator is told to refresh only while that
# shell is installed; plan 18 0.3.2 removes the call with the bar.
# Hyprland-only (hyprsunset); the compositor contract replaces it at 0.4.1.
